    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up as a house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your limbs stretch through endless rooms filled with grotesque creatures. You can never see outside of yourself, never feel the world that lies beyond the fleshy walls of your body. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You manage your insides as best as you can, but you wonder : are you a good house or just a pale afterthought of the House Before ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The House Before is a story based adventure game with some light puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/458a49b00b6d99e93b51077f8ea8d20a.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/458a49b00b6d99e93b51077f8ea8d20a.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/458a49b00b6d99e93b51077f8ea8d20a.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal old wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/f68fcf8c7a20966829cfdd2801a4881c.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/f68fcf8c7a20966829cfdd2801a4881c.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/f68fcf8c7a20966829cfdd2801a4881c.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a good house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/dbb64376e89a3c8be56578b41cb0ad9d.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/dbb64376e89a3c8be56578b41cb0ad9d.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/dbb64376e89a3c8be56578b41cb0ad9d.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember who you used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/96e6d0276308bca94e178dcb491134eb.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/96e6d0276308bca94e178dcb491134eb.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/96e6d0276308bca94e178dcb491134eb.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/a9e1b1de4d3f2a0e25067a3f43b8d643.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/a9e1b1de4d3f2a0e25067a3f43b8d643.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/a9e1b1de4d3f2a0e25067a3f43b8d643.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procreate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/5dd227b7f5790fd0650d206be15522fb.avif?t=1739453863\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be better than the House Before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/c6a5b170860a7d04bf6c2ab5e636110b.poster.avif?t=1739453863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/c6a5b170860a7d04bf6c2ab5e636110b.webm?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779750/extras/c6a5b170860a7d04bf6c2ab5e636110b.mp4?t=1739453863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
